#: web/src/routes/privacy/+page.svelte:165
msgid ""
"Profile pictures: if you have not uploaded one, the server may look up "
"your Gravatar. It sends Gravatar a SHA-256 hash of your email address "
"(never the address itself), receives the image, and keeps a copy for up "
"to 24 hours. Your browser and the Android app never contact Gravatar, so "
"only the server's address is visible to it. Gravatar processes the "
"request under its own privacy policy. You can turn this off in your "
"account settings, and the instance operator can disable it for the whole "
"instance."
msgstr ""
"Profile pictures: if you have not uploaded one, the server may look up "
"your Gravatar. It sends Gravatar a SHA-256 hash of your email address "
"(never the address itself), receives the image, and keeps a copy for up "
"to 24 hours. Your browser and the Android app never contact Gravatar, so "
"only the server's address is visible to it. Gravatar processes the "
"request under its own privacy policy. You can turn this off in your "
"account settings, and the instance operator can disable it for the whole "
"instance."

